          "Id": "falker_001",
          "PromptText": "Hello there!\n\nI'm Joshua Falker, and I hope you have a moment to help me out here!\n\nYou see, my last assistant didn't return from his assignment…\n\nI am responsible for the safety of our researchers and visitors to Nascence…\n\nCurrently we have an issue with the populations of Swift Silvertails and Barking Chimeras… this is where you come in!\n\nWe need to reduce the population by 10 for each of these species. Will you help us?",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "capture 20260822-221109 AppendText",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "falker_001_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "Yes!",
              "TextEvidence": "capture 20260822-221109",
              "NextNodeId": "falker_002",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "falker_001_option_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "No!",
              "TextEvidence": "capture 20260822-221109",
              "NextNodeId": "falker_uncaptured",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "falker_001_option_2",
              "Index": 2,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "capture 20260822-221109",
              "NextNodeId": "close",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Id": "falker_001_option_2_end",
                  "Type": "EndDialogue",
                  "QuestId": null,
                  "Text": "Safe close"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "falker_002",
          "PromptText": "Here are your tasks. Good luck to you!\n\nOh, and if you find anything that might be of interest, I suggest you contact Dr. Rosenblatt…",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "capture 20260822-221109 AppendText after QFU",
          "Options": [
            {
