          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "fala_insignia_trade_hold",
          "PromptText": "Show me what you found.",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "capture 20260822-224319 before insignia StartTrade",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "fala_insignia_trade_hold_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "(Continue after trade)",
              "TextEvidence": "capture 20260822-224319",
              "NextNodeId": "fala_turnin",
              "Actions": []
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "fala_turnin",
          "PromptText": "Show me what you found.\n\nWell done, {player}. But I must tell you...\n\nThe path you have chosen will take you through the deepest depths of darkness.\n\nYou will face beings with hearts filled of hate and jealousy.\n\nAnd you will wish for the Divine to interfere, but unfortunately it can not.\n\nThe cursed ones are setting their plan in motion.\n\nThe script is written and the stage is set.\n\nIt is, however, not too late to change the outcome.\n\nBut we must stay true to the light, or we will surely perish as the acts unfold.\n\nTake the Insignia to the statue raised in Abans glory.\n\nPlace it at Her sacred feet and you will gain passage to Her Garden.\n\nSomeone well versed in what once was will be able to tell you more about the Ancient Device. Seek him out, child.",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "capture 20260822-224319 AppendText after insignia trade; trade adapter pending",
